@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@modelId = 01JXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

### Get leaderboard (ELO-ranked)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard
Accept: application/json

###

### Get leaderboard sorted by Green Score
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard?sortBy=GreenScore
Accept: application/json

###

### Get kill list for a model
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard/{{modelId}}/killlist
Accept: application/json
